	<key>readme</key>
	<string>This workflow enables you to manage your Bluetooth device connections and Bluetooth state directly from Alfred. It offers the following functionalities:

* Displays a list of all paired devices along with their connection status (connected or disconnected).
* Connects or disconnects from a paired Bluetooth device.
* Turns Bluetooth on or off for your device, or toggles it with btt.
* Copies a diagnostics report (btdiag) for issue reports.

For details see workflow github page - https://github.com/bosha/alfred-blueman-workflow</string>
